otifications, registration emails, and newsletters to your customers. But you may as well use only one email account for all these purposes.',1),(3465,'admin.configurationsteps.emailaccountlist.emailaccounts2.title','Email accounts',1),(3466,'admin.configurationsteps.nextpage','Next page',1),(3467,'admin.configurationsteps.nextstep','Next',1),(3468,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.activate.text','To activate a payment method click the <b>Edit</b> button, then tick the <b>Is active</b> checkbox and save the changes.',1),(3469,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.activate.title','Activate a payment method',1),(3470,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.checkmoney.text','Check/money orders are often used by government agencies or large businesses. Rather than paying directly through your site, shoppers will request that you send them a Purchase order (PO), and they will send the payment back. Most of the order processing is handled outside of the software. This method is already enabled.',1),(3471,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.checkmoney.title','Check/money order',1),(3472,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.configure.text','You can configure each payment method by clicking the appropriate <b>Configure</b> button.',1),(3473,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.configure.title','Configure a payment method',1),(3474,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.manual.text','This is a special payment plugin that allows all orders to be successfully entered on the website, but it does NOT really charge a customer or make any calls to any live payment gateway. This payment method is recommended if you want to perform one of the following: <ul><li>Process all orders offline</li><li>Process them manually via another back-office system</li><li>Test the site end-to-end before going live</li></ul>',1),(3475,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.manual.title','Credit card (manual)',1),(3476,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.paypalcommerce.