tionsteps.paymentpaypal.register.title','Register an account',1),(3490,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentpaypal.sandbox.text','Use sandbox if you want to test the payment method first.',1),(3491,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentpaypal.sandbox.title','Sandbox',1),(3492,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.paymentmethods.text','You can see all the payment methods (plugins) allowed to use in your store on this page. However, you can always find much more in our marketplace.',1),(3493,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.paymentmethods.title','Payment methods',1),(3494,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.paypal.text','If you want to process payments online, weâ€™d recommend you to set up the PayPal Commerce payment method. PayPal Commerce gives your buyers a simplified and secure checkout experience. Learn how to set this plugin <a href=\"{0}\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.',1),(3495,'admin.configurationsteps.paymentmethods.paypal.title','PayPal Commerce',1),(3496,'admin.configurationsteps.personalizestore.basicadvanced.text','This two-position <b>Basic/Advanced</b> switch allows you to switch between the page display modes. For convenience of use, the most frequent settings are shown in the Basic mode. If you cannot find a required setting on a page, switch to the Advanced mode to see all the available settings.',1),(3497,'admin.configurationsteps.personalizestore.basicadvanced.title','â€œBasic/Advancedâ€ modes',1),(3498,'admin.configurationsteps.personalizestore.description','Choose a beautiful theme for your store and add your logo',1),(3499,'admin.configurationsteps.personalizestore.intro.text','Let us help you to configure your store! We will share a few tips, describing the most important fields for the initial configuration.',1),(3500,'admin.configurationsteps.personalizestore.intro.title','Configuration tour',1),(3501,'admin.configurationsteps.personalizestore.logo.text','In this field, click the <b>Upload a file</b> button, then choose your logo file.',1),(3502,'admin.configurationsteps.personalizestore.logo.title','Upload your logo',1),(3503,'admin.configurationsteps.personalizestore.theme.text','On this page, you can set up your store theme. After you choose a theme on our <a href=\"{0}\" target=\"_blank\">marketplace</a>, upload it on your site following <a href=\"{1}\" target=\"_blank\">these instructions</a>. Then refresh this page, and you will see all the available themes. Choose one and click the <b>Save</b> button in the top right.',1),(3504,'admin.configurationsteps.personalizestore.theme.title','Choose a theme',1),(3505,'admin.configurationsteps.personalizestore.title','Personalize your store',1),(3506,'admin.configurationsteps.poweredby.description','Remove the â€œPowered by nopCommerceâ€ link from the footer',1),(3507,'admin.configurationsteps.poweredby.title','â€œPowered byâ€ link',1),(3508,'admin.configurationsteps.product.details.text','Enter the relevant product details in these fields. The screenshot below shows how they will be displayed on the product page with the default nopCommerce theme: <div class=\"row row-cols-1\"><img class=\"img-thumbnail mt-3\" src=\"/js/admintour/images/product-page.jpg\"/></div>',1),(3509,'admin.configurationsteps.product.details.title','Product details',1),(3510,'admin.configurationsteps.product.inventory.text','Enter the product inventory info here. <br> <ul><li>The <b>Donâ€™t track inventory</b> option allows you to opt for no tracking</li><li>The <b>Track inventory</b> option is for those who donâ€™t have product variants and need to know just how many items are left</li><li>The <b>Track inventory by product attributes</b> option is best for you if you have different product attributes combinations and need to track their stock quantities</li></ul>',1),(3511,'admin.configurationsteps.product.inventory.title','Product inventory',1),(3512,'admin.configurationsteps.product.pictures.text','You can add pictures to your product after you save it for the first time. Click the <b>Save</b> button in the top right and then proceed to the pictures panel.',1),(3513,'admin.configurationsteps.product.pictures.title','Product pictures',1),(3514,'admin.configurationsteps.product.price.text','Enter the product price in a predefined currency here. Read more on how to manage currencies <a href=\"{0}\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.',1),(3515,'admin.configurationsteps.product.price.title','Product price',1),(3516,'admin.configurationsteps.product.settingsbutton.text','This â€œSettingsâ€ button allows you to set up the basic mode to choose which fields you want to be shown exactly on the product edit page.',1),(3517,'admin.configurationsteps.product.settingsbutton.title','â€œSettingsâ€ button',1),(3518,'admin.configurationsteps.product.shipping.text','Define product-specific shipping details in this panel.',1),(3519,'admin.configurationsteps.product.shipping.title','Product shipping info',1),(3520,'admin.configurationsteps.product.tax.text','Select the product tax category or tick the <b>Tax exempt</b> if needed.',1),(3521,'admin.configurationsteps.product.tax.title','Product tax category',1),(3522,'admin.configurationsteps.setuppayments.description','Choose how your customers will pay for their orders',1),(3523,'admin.configurationsteps.setuppayments.title','Set up payments',1),(3524,'admin.configurationsteps.setupshipping.description','Set up shipping methods to deliver orders to customers',1),(3525,'admin.configurationsteps.setupshipping.title','Set up shipping',1),(3526,'admin.configurationsteps.setuptaxes.description','Configure rates manually or choose a tax service to automate all tax things',1),(3527,'admin.configurationsteps.setuptaxes.title','Set up taxes',1),(3528,'admin.configurationsteps.shippingproviders.activate.text','To activate a shipping provider click the <b>Edit</b> button, then tick the <b>Is active</b> checkbox and save the changes.',1),(3529,'admin.configurationsteps.shippingproviders.activate.title','Activate a provider',1),(3530,'admin.configurationsteps.shippingproviders.configure.text','Now weâ€™ll configure the Manual shipping provider. Click this button to proceed to the plugin configuration page.',1),(3531,'admin.configurationsteps.shippingproviders.configure.title','Configure Manual',1),(3532,'admin.configurationsteps.shippingproviders.manual.text','The only active shipping plugin by default is <b>Manual</b>. This provider allows you to configure shipping methods and rates manually.',1),(3533,'admin.configurationsteps.shippingproviders.manual.title','Manual shipping provider',1),(3534,'admin.configurationsteps.shippingproviders.providers.text','You can see all the shipping providers (plugins) allowed to use in your store on this page. However, you can always find much more in our <a href=\"{0}\" target=\"_blank\">marketplace</a>.',1),(3535,'admin.configurationsteps.shippingproviders.providers.title','Shipping providers',1),(3536,'admin.configurationsteps.store.name.text','Enter your store name in this field. It will be displayed, for instance, in the newsletter and notification emails sent to your customers.',1),(3537,'admin.configurationsteps.store.name.title','Your store name',1),(3538,'admin.configurationsteps.store.ssl.text','If you already have an SSL certificate installed on the server, enable SSL to protect your customersâ€™ data. <b>Do not enable it if you donâ€™t have an SSL certificate installed yet!</b> SSL Certificates provide customer trust and improve site rankings. Note that some online payment methods require an SSL certificate installed for correct working. Read how to install and configure SSL certificates <a href=\"{0}\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.',1),(3539,'admin.configurationsteps.store.ssl.title','Enable SSL',1),(3540,'admin.configurationsteps.store.url.text','Enter your store URL in this field. For example, it could be http://www.yourstore.com/ or https://www.yourstore.com/mystore/ if you installed your store in a subdirectory.',1),(3541,'admin.