scription.customer.newpm','This message template is used when the customer gets a notification about a new private message being received. You can set up this option by ticking the checkbox <strong>Show alert for PM</strong> in Configuration - Settings - Forum settings.',1),(3772,'admin.contentmanagement.messagetemplates.description.customer.passwordrecovery','This message template is used when a customer forgets a password needed to log in the account. The customer receives a message with a link for entering a new password.',1),(3773,'admin.contentmanagement.messagetemplates.description.customer.welcomemessage','This message template is used to welcome a new customer after registration.',1),(3774,'admin.contentmanagement.messagetemplates.description.customer.gdpr.deleterequest','This message template is used when customer create a new request to delete account. The message is received by a store owner.',1),(3775,'admin.contentmanagement.messagetemplates.description.forums.newforumpost','This message template is used when a new forum post in certain forum topic is created. The message is received by a store owner.',1),(3776,'admin.contentmanagement.messagetemplates.description.forums.newforumtopic','This message template is used when a new forum topic is created. The message is received by a store owner.',1),(3777,'admin.contentmanagement.messagetemplates.description.giftcard.notification','This message template is used to send a notification to a customer about getting a gift card.',1),(3778,'admin.contentmanagement.messagetemplates.description.newcustomer.notification','This message template is used when a new customer is registered. The message is received by a store owner. You can set upÂ this option by ticking the checkbox <strong>Notify about new customer registration</strong> in Configuration - Settings - Customer settings.',1),(3779,'admin.contentmanagement.messagetemplates.description.newreturnrequest.customernotification','This message template is used to 